        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold font-heading text-white">
          Your Business Data. Strictly Isolated & Protected.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-content-muted leading-relaxed">
          Engineered on PostgreSQL with database-enforced Row Level Security (RLS) so your organization's prices, customer lists, and financial books remain 100% private.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 relative z-10">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-navy-800/80 border border-brand-500/20 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-300 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-heading text-white">Multi-Tenant Isolation</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-content-muted leading-relaxed">
            Every transaction is bounded to your organization ID at the database layer. No user or branch can ever access another company's records.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-navy-800/80 border border-brand-500/20 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-300 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-heading text-white">Role-Based Controls</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-content-muted leading-relaxed">
            Granular permissions for Owners, Sales Staff, Inventory Managers, and Accountants prevent unauthorized price changes or inventory writes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-navy-800/80 border border-brand-500/20 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-300 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-heading text-white">Permanent Audit Trails</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-content-muted leading-relaxed">
            Every stock movement, invoice creation, and payment receipt maintains an unalterable audit log with timestamp and user attribution.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  {/* SECTION 7: FINAL CTA BANNER — VIBRANT TEAL GRADIENT */}
  <section class="py-18 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-700 via-brand-600 to-brand-800 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
